1
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,833
Dear May Deer,

2
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,667
With a lovely family,

3
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:15,250
Dreaming of growing up each day.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,167
Shy Chuan-Chuan Pangolin,

5
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:18,667
Quiet, with not a word to say,

6
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:21,667
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

7
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:22,333
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

8
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:23,917
Don’t be shy!

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Sing out loud!

10
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:25,833
Sing out loud!

11
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:27,417
Let your imagination shine!

12
00:00:30,667 --> 00:00:31,167
Good friends in the forest,

13
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:33,083
Growing and playing together,

14
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:34,000
Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan!

15
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,500
ODEER MAYO / Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan

16
00:00:37,676 --> 00:00:40,082
Time Capsule

17
00:00:40,917 --> 00:00:43,417
Today is Chuan-Chuan’s fifth birthday.

18
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:48,167
His mom invited all of Chuan-Chuan’s good friends to his birthday party.

19
00:00:48,917 --> 00:00:50,417
Hi, Chuan-Chuan!

20
00:00:50,417 --> 00:00:52,083
It’s your birthday today!

21
00:00:52,083 --> 00:00:53,750
Here we are!

22
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,583
Welcome, everyone!

23
00:00:57,583 --> 00:00:59,917
Happy birthday, Chuan-Chuan!

24
00:01:01,417 --> 00:01:03,417
Happy Birthday!

25
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,583
May every day be happy!

26
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:07,917
Th-thank you, everyone!

27
00:01:09,083 --> 00:01:12,333
I-I’m a little embarrassed.

28
00:01:12,583 --> 00:01:14,083
Haha, that’s okay.

29
00:01:14,083 --> 00:01:16,833
Chuan-Chuan, you’ve become so much more outgoing!

30
00:01:16,833 --> 00:01:20,583
Wow, Chuan-Chuan! Your house is so unusual. It has so many doors!

31
00:01:20,583 --> 00:01:22,167
Yeah! It’s so interesting. Mwah!

32
00:01:23,167 --> 00:01:25,583
I think we could play hide-and-seek here!

33
00:01:25,583 --> 00:01:26,250
Hehe!

34
00:01:27,167 --> 00:01:28,083
Whoa!

35
00:01:31,583 --> 00:01:32,417
Ahhh!

36
00:01:34,583 --> 00:01:35,583
Hahaha!

37
00:01:35,583 --> 00:01:38,167
My mom and dad are both tunnel architects.

38
00:01:38,167 --> 00:01:40,583
W-we have lots of passageways in our house.

39
00:01:40,583 --> 00:01:42,333
I’ll show you around!

40
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:43,667
That’s so cool!

41
00:01:43,667 --> 00:01:47,667
Come on! I-I’ll give you a tour.

42
00:01:47,667 --> 00:01:50,417
Okay!

43
00:01:57,333 --> 00:01:59,167
Welcome, children! Come on in!

44
00:01:59,333 --> 00:02:00,833
Hello, ma’am!

45
00:02:00,833 --> 00:02:04,083
Thank you so much for coming to Chuan-Chuan’s birthday party.

46
00:02:04,083 --> 00:02:06,917
Today is Chuan-Chuan’s fifth birthday.

47
00:02:06,917 --> 00:02:10,917
According to tradition, let’s play a special game.

48
00:02:10,917 --> 00:02:13,083
Wow! A game? That’s wonderful!

49
00:02:13,083 --> 00:02:14,917
I love games!

50
00:02:14,917 --> 00:02:16,417
And the game is…

51
00:02:16,417 --> 00:02:16,750
Ta-da!

52
00:02:17,833 --> 00:02:19,917
A time-capsule wish letter!

53
00:02:20,167 --> 00:02:21,333
A time capsule?

54
00:02:21,583 --> 00:02:23,417
What’s that? Is it something to eat?

55
00:02:23,583 --> 00:02:25,000
Hehe, be patient.

56
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,583
First, let’s write our wish cards.

57
00:02:27,583 --> 00:02:30,167
Write down your hopes for the coming year.

58
00:02:30,167 --> 00:02:34,000
For example, my wish is to get thinner.

59
00:02:34,167 --> 00:02:35,833
I’m done!

60
00:02:35,833 --> 00:02:37,167
Haha, okay!

61
00:02:37,333 --> 00:02:38,833
Let’s draw our wishes instead!

62
00:02:39,167 --> 00:02:44,000
Everyone drew their own wishes.

63
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,333
All right, is everyone finished?

64
00:02:45,333 --> 00:02:48,833
Next, let’s go find the time capsule!

65
00:02:52,583 --> 00:02:57,333
Yoo-hoo! Yoo-hoo! Yoo-hoo!

66
00:02:57,833 --> 00:03:00,417
Wow! It really is like a maze!

67
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:08,583
Wow! Is this a beach, or a bunch of little hills?

68
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Uh, this is an anthill.

69
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,333
It’s where we store our food.

70
00:03:16,583 --> 00:03:18,583
I don’t think it’s this way.

71
00:03:18,583 --> 00:03:21,667
Yoo-hoo! Yoo-hoo! Yoo-hoo!

72
00:03:21,667 --> 00:03:23,333
Yoo-hoo!

73
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:26,333
Huh? This is Chuan-Chuan’s music room.

74
00:03:26,333 --> 00:03:27,500
It’s not here, either.

75
00:03:27,667 --> 00:03:30,833
Yoo-hoo! Yoo-hoo!

76
00:03:30,833 --> 00:03:34,417
Chuan-Chuan’s dad has a poor sense of direction. I think he’s lost.

77
00:03:34,417 --> 00:03:38,333
Uh, I think this is right. We should be close.

78
00:03:38,333 --> 00:03:41,083
Chuan-Chuan, is your dad lost?

79
00:03:41,083 --> 00:03:44,083
Dad isn’t very good with directions, but we should be almost there.

80
00:03:44,083 --> 00:03:46,000
We should be almost there.

81
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,417
Ha!

82
00:03:46,667 --> 00:03:47,083
Ha!

83
00:03:47,083 --> 00:03:49,333
Honey, is it this door?

84
00:03:52,917 --> 00:03:55,083
Yes! This is the place.

85
00:03:55,083 --> 00:03:56,333
A time capsule?

86
00:03:56,333 --> 00:03:58,417
Let me look.

87
00:03:58,417 --> 00:04:00,167
Oh, right! It’s buried here.

88
00:04:00,333 --> 00:04:02,250
Let’s dig it up!

89
00:04:03,583 --> 00:04:05,167
This is the time capsule.

90
00:04:05,833 --> 00:04:07,583
It has the wishes we made last year inside.

91
00:04:09,250 --> 00:04:11,167
Last year, I kept getting fatter,

92
00:04:11,167 --> 00:04:13,333
so I put in a slim-fitting outfit.

93
00:04:13,583 --> 00:04:16,250
Looks like it didn’t work. Hehehe!

94
00:04:16,583 --> 00:04:19,667
Last year, my wish was for Chuan-Chuan to be a little braver

95
00:04:19,667 --> 00:04:22,417
and not always cling to his mom’s tail.

96
00:04:22,667 --> 00:04:23,667
How cute!

97
00:04:23,667 --> 00:04:24,250
Mwah!

98
00:04:24,417 --> 00:04:26,833
Chuan-Chuan, what was your wish?

99
00:04:26,833 --> 00:04:28,083
Last year, I…

100
00:04:28,083 --> 00:04:30,833
I wished I could make new friends

101
00:04:30,833 --> 00:04:32,583
and stop being so shy.

102
00:04:32,667 --> 00:04:35,833
Chuan-Chuan, you’re not nearly as shy anymore. Mwah!

103
00:04:35,833 --> 00:04:37,833
That’s right! We’re all good friends.

104
00:04:38,917 --> 00:04:41,000
That means your wish came true!

105
00:04:42,667 --> 00:04:46,000
All right, now we can put our wish cards inside.

106
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,833
I hope I can eat the most delicious food ever!

107
00:04:48,833 --> 00:04:51,333
I-I hope I can move to Mars.

108
00:04:51,333 --> 00:04:54,083
I-I hope my eyes will shine brighter.

109
00:04:54,083 --> 00:04:56,250
What about you, Chuan-Chuan?

110
00:04:56,250 --> 00:04:56,917
I…

111
00:04:56,917 --> 00:04:59,083
I hope that on this day next year,

112
00:04:59,083 --> 00:05:01,417
we can all celebrate a birthday together again.

113
00:05:01,750 --> 00:05:03,750
I love you all so much!

114
00:05:05,417 --> 00:05:07,250
We definitely will!

115
00:05:13,667 --> 00:05:14,917
We’re finally done!

116
00:05:14,917 --> 00:05:15,667
Children!

117
00:05:15,667 --> 00:05:18,167
So, what should we do now?

118
00:05:18,167 --> 00:05:20,167
Eat cake!

119
00:05:20,167 --> 00:05:21,333
Let’s go!

120
00:05:21,333 --> 00:05:23,167
Let’s go back to the living room.

121
00:05:23,167 --> 00:05:25,083
Okay!

122
00:05:25,083 --> 00:05:27,333
But how do we get to the living room?

123
00:05:29,333 --> 00:05:32,083
Dad, the living room…

124
00:05:32,083 --> 00:05:34,750
It’s actually right next door.

125
00:05:35,833 --> 00:05:38,833
After all that, were we taking the long way around?

126
00:05:39,083 --> 00:05:41,583
Hahaha! This is so much fun!

127
00:05:45,500 --> 00:05:47,167
May, ever since I met you,

128
00:05:47,167 --> 00:05:49,000
I’m not so shy anymore.

129
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,250
Thank you for helping my wish come true.

130
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:53,750
Chuan-Chuan, you did it through your own hard work.

131
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,583
Let’s do this again next year!

132
00:05:55,583 --> 00:05:57,417
Okay! It’s a promise!

133
00:05:58,083 --> 00:05:58,417
That’s right.

134
00:05:58,417 --> 00:06:01,083
Because we’ll always be the best of friends.

135
00:06:01,083 --> 00:06:03,250
Hahahaha!
